WEBVTT

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:15.250
Karte 9 - The Carbuncle

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:42.520
Hey! What are you
doing to my car?

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:09.340
The attacks have occurred
all over the metropolitan area.

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:11.040
There have been 18 cases
in the past year,

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:13.020
all exclusively targeting
foreign luxury cars,

00:01:13.050 --> 00:01:15.490
causing over 200 million yen
of damage.

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:18.680
All the losses have been covered
by insurance, right?

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:21.660
People who drive
foreign luxury cars aren't idiots.

00:01:22.130 --> 00:01:24.150
No one's gotten killed so far,

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:26.060
and I'm amazed you guys are
making such a big fuss...

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:27.160
with this investigative
committee!

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:28.360
- Takasugi!
- Besides that,

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:29.560
I work Juvenile Division.

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:32.700
Can't you guys in Third Division
handle this yourselves?

00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:36.730
Despite appearances,
I've got a lot on my plate.

00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:40.740
No, I want to turn this
over to Juvenile Division.

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:43.110
We've just gotten very compelling
testimony from one of the attacks.

00:01:43.150 --> 00:01:46.710
The suspect is 140 cm tall
and approximately 12 years old!

00:01:47.690 --> 00:01:50.310
This video is from
a parking lot security camera.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:02.870
<i>That people accept life and live</i>
<i>through the long months and years...</i>

00:02:02.900 --> 00:02:04.730
<i>is very nearly miraculous.</i>

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:06.570
<i>So said one philosopher.</i>

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:10.300
<i>This particular case</i>
<i>made me realize that as well.</i>

00:02:11.040 --> 00:02:15.100
<i>People do not simply live</i>
<i>as biological mechanisms.</i>

00:02:15.450 --> 00:02:17.920
<i>That's because they also possess</i>
<i>what we call a soul.</i>

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:20.910
<i>And the soul can be</i>
<i>extremely uncertain, fragile,</i>

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:22.010
<i>and occasionally</i>
<i>incomprehensible.</i>

00:02:28.360 --> 00:02:31.660
Okay, 2530 Setagaya, Akamedai.

00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:35.220
This the place, Mister?
It's a mansion!

00:02:35.270 --> 00:02:37.670
That's a mansion, all right!

00:02:39.440 --> 00:02:40.700
This way, please.

00:02:46.450 --> 00:02:50.140
May I present Koichiro Tsuzuki,
master of this house.

00:02:53.550 --> 00:02:55.820
Y-You've finally come...

00:02:56.620 --> 00:02:58.590
Please, help me!

00:02:59.590 --> 00:03:02.890
I don't know
what else to do now!

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:14.900
Clinical Chart 9
The Carbuncle with a Human Face

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:37.820
I don't want to hear
your sad good-byes.

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:41.530
So, get on with it
and leave me!

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:46.060
'Cause this hasn't been
the type of love...

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:49.830
where I thought I'd get
back everything.

00:03:59.820 --> 00:04:02.950
Gave up all I had
to be with you.

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:06.790
The least you could do
is face me!

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:11.200
As you starve yourself,
you waste away...

00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:14.800
like you're crucified
and dying!

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:22.700
Enrobed in the dark
of my heart...

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:30.740
I take the memories we had, and
throw them out forever!

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:36.920
Way down deep
inside your sober, searching eyes...

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:39.580
emerges
a pitch-black shadow that...

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:41.960
reminds me of a god of death.

00:04:41.990 --> 00:04:45.790
After all,
you never let me see inside...

00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:50.360
see inside that heart of yours.
Oh...

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:53.740
I must look
like I'm a tiny little child...

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:56.370
who buries
my head into your lap...

00:04:56.410 --> 00:04:58.840
to cry into your waiting arms.

00:04:58.880 --> 00:05:02.370
Just before
I fell apart was when I saw...

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:06.480
saw the sun
peek out of the clouds.

00:05:29.880 --> 00:05:34.180
<i>Banking, automotives,</i>
<i>electronics, general trading...</i>

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:40.180
<i>The Tsuzuki Group possessed major</i>
<i>influence on the world's economy.</i>

00:05:40.990 --> 00:05:43.180
<i>Five years ago,</i>
<i>at the young age of 30,</i>

00:05:43.220 --> 00:05:46.350
<i>the eighth generation head</i>
<i>of the family took power...</i>

00:05:46.390 --> 00:05:48.790
<i>this man, Koichiro Tsuzuki.</i>

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:54.560
I hear the Tsuzuki Group
is affiliated with...

00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:56.800
many world-class hospitals
with fine doctors.

00:05:57.470 --> 00:06:00.270
I'd like to start by seeing
the chart on that tumor.

00:06:00.310 --> 00:06:02.900
Doctor... There is no chart.

00:06:03.780 --> 00:06:05.940
I'm the leader of the Group...

00:06:06.410 --> 00:06:09.210
meaning I must be perfect!

00:06:09.250 --> 00:06:12.620
I must be a man
without a single weakness!

00:06:13.620 --> 00:06:16.550
Meaning you haven't consulted
a doctor until now?

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:23.490
I've never even shown it
to my father or mother.

00:06:24.260 --> 00:06:27.630
The only people who know
about this awful growth...

00:06:27.670 --> 00:06:29.130
are my wife, Machiko,

00:06:29.170 --> 00:06:32.970
and Taneda here, who has
served me since I was a child.

00:06:33.510 --> 00:06:34.470
Taneda?

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:40.440
Dr. Black Jack...
The reason I asked you to come...

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:43.610
is not just because
you're a world-famous doctor,

00:06:43.650 --> 00:06:47.280
but also because
I feel I can trust you.

00:06:48.650 --> 00:06:51.150
I beg you, do not
reveal this to anyone.

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:54.890
I, too, beg of you!

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:57.290
That goes without saying.

00:06:57.700 --> 00:07:00.320
A doctor is bound
to protect his patient's privacy.

00:07:06.470 --> 00:07:07.630
<i>The human-faced carbuncle.</i>

00:07:07.670 --> 00:07:11.070
<i>It's mentioned in the literature</i>
<i>of the world, not simply in Japan.</i>

00:07:11.980 --> 00:07:15.070
<i>While there are legends and rumors,</i>
<i>none has ever been...</i>

00:07:15.110 --> 00:07:17.210
<i>subjected</i>
<i>to scientific analysis.</i>

00:07:17.420 --> 00:07:19.940
<i>For example, the Shio village case</i>
<i>in Shiogawa prefecture...</i>

00:07:19.990 --> 00:07:23.010
<i>in the autumn of 1939.</i>

00:07:23.220 --> 00:07:25.660
<i>Ryousaku,</i>
<i>the son of Ei Miyamae...</i>

00:07:25.690 --> 00:07:27.590
<i>killed an enormous toad.</i>

00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:29.020
More light!

00:07:29.060 --> 00:07:29.690
Yes, sir!

00:07:30.330 --> 00:07:34.230
<i>When he did, body fluids from the</i>
<i>toad splashed onto his abdomen.</i>

00:07:35.070 --> 00:07:37.800
<i>Ryousaku developed</i>
<i>a sudden fever four or five days later...</i>

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:40.400
<i>and a tumor formed</i>
<i>on his abdomen.</i>

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:45.700
<i>It grew larger and took on the</i>
<i>appearance of the dead toad's face.</i>

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:49.680
<i>Soon the mouth was eating insects</i>
<i>and even speaking.</i>

00:07:51.050 --> 00:07:53.610
Any pain or itchiness?

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:56.890
<i>You might just dismiss</i>
<i>the reports as nonsense,</i>

00:07:57.460 --> 00:08:00.580
<i>but all references to these</i>
<i>carbuncles share a common feature.</i>

00:08:00.630 --> 00:08:03.820
<i>Being that no matter</i>
<i>how many times they're cut off,</i>

00:08:03.860 --> 00:08:06.390
<i>they regrow in the same spot</i>
<i>with the same appearance.</i>

00:08:07.400 --> 00:08:09.230
<i>And that</i>
<i>the patients generally...</i>

00:08:09.270 --> 00:08:12.000
<i>suffer mental or even</i>
<i>physical deterioration,</i>

00:08:12.040 --> 00:08:14.160
<i>resulting in death.</i>

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:15.940
Doctor.

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:20.300
A room has been prepared
for you in the mansion.

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:24.580
Please feel free to stay here
for the length of the examination.

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:26.180
I'm afraid I can't.

00:08:26.820 --> 00:08:28.980
There's more I want to check out
before I try to remove it.

00:08:29.590 --> 00:08:31.820
And the medicines
and equipment here are inadequate.

00:08:32.820 --> 00:08:33.760
Taneda!

00:08:33.790 --> 00:08:34.550
Ma'am!

00:08:35.560 --> 00:08:38.260
Taneda has
prepared everything.

00:08:44.470 --> 00:08:47.730
Taneda had planned on
being a doctor when he was younger.

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:53.940
Doctor! This scanner was
released only just this year!

00:08:53.980 --> 00:08:57.470
It seems he still studies it
in his spare time.

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:01.020
No, please... I did it all
for Master Koichiro.

00:09:01.820 --> 00:09:03.750
You can even do surgery in here!

00:09:04.460 --> 00:09:07.720
Please, if you need anything,
just tell me.

00:09:08.590 --> 00:09:10.990
Very well. I'll use it.

00:09:15.670 --> 00:09:17.070
Inspector Takasugi!

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:20.640
We just got an interesting report
from forensics.

00:09:20.810 --> 00:09:24.070
Leave it till tomorrow!
It's my daughter's birthday today!

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:26.640
Have a look
at these fingerprints.

00:09:27.010 --> 00:09:30.450
Kami's made a homemade cake
and everything!

00:09:31.150 --> 00:09:34.880
The smaller one was lifted from
the axe found in the parking lot.

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:38.120
The larger one is
from the scene of case M-37.

00:09:39.420 --> 00:09:41.390
Case M-37?

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:42.520
You following me?

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:46.190
If we match sizes,
the prints line up.

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:54.160
What? The suspect
in case M-37 was...

00:09:54.210 --> 00:09:56.300
Yes. A woman.

00:09:56.340 --> 00:10:00.140
Age 27, 165 cm tall,
worked as an office lady.

00:10:00.750 --> 00:10:03.410
She checks into a love hotel,
then murders her male companion.

00:10:04.880 --> 00:10:07.650
Six cases in the last two years.

00:10:09.050 --> 00:10:10.820
From the prints
taken from the scenes,

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:13.050
we concluded it's all
done by one person.

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:15.360
The department established
a special investigative unit...

00:10:15.390 --> 00:10:17.730
for this Love Hotel Killer,
and are still searching for her.

00:10:19.330 --> 00:10:21.160
It's gotta be a coincidence!

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:24.640
One's a boy, the other's a woman!
And the print sizes don't match!

00:10:25.300 --> 00:10:26.790
There's one more thing!

00:10:26.840 --> 00:10:28.700
The woman's umbrella...

00:10:29.640 --> 00:10:30.630
It's yellow.

00:10:30.680 --> 00:10:34.040
Just drop your crazy theory!
It's ridiculous!

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:39.110
<i>I'm working out</i>
<i>the tumor's structure.</i>

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:41.240
<i>Now moving</i>
<i>to detailed examination.</i>

00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:44.580
<i>Results at this stage</i>
<i>indicate it's not malignant.</i>

00:10:45.820 --> 00:10:48.220
<i>Scanner shows</i>
<i>no sign of festering.</i>

00:10:48.390 --> 00:10:51.950
<i>Its contents shows</i>
<i>no sign of keratinization.</i>

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:54.700
<i>While still unconfirmed,</i>
<i>if I find no signs...</i>

00:10:54.730 --> 00:10:56.500
<i>of bacterial</i>
<i>or viral infection,</i>

00:10:56.540 --> 00:10:59.370
<i>the odds are good that I can</i>
<i>declare it a benign tumor.</i>

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:04.270
<i>Still, its shape</i>
<i>makes it very unusual.</i>

00:11:04.980 --> 00:11:09.240
<i>And the patient's explanation</i>
<i>of the tumor's details...</i>

00:11:09.280 --> 00:11:11.610
<i>left me perplexed,</i>
<i>to say the least.</i>

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:16.750
I first noticed it
when I was six years old.

00:11:17.560 --> 00:11:20.390
A yellowish blotch
appeared on my abdomen.

00:11:20.730 --> 00:11:23.020
But it gradually spread.

00:11:23.060 --> 00:11:25.530
By age eight, it was bulging out.

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:27.830
It began looking
like a human face!

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:31.360
Finally, at age ten,
it suddenly began talking to me!

00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:34.570
What did it say?

00:11:34.610 --> 00:11:37.700
I'll never forget!
What it said to me...

00:11:37.740 --> 00:11:38.970
and its voice!

00:11:39.780 --> 00:11:41.300
It said...

00:11:41.350 --> 00:11:45.040
Don't bother. Leave it to me.

00:11:46.150 --> 00:11:48.210
Leave what to whom?

00:11:54.790 --> 00:11:56.060
Since that day...

00:11:57.030 --> 00:12:00.230
Since that day,
I've been fighting it!

00:12:01.870 --> 00:12:04.960
My hellish, unrelenting war!

00:12:08.570 --> 00:12:12.440
You probably
don't believe me, Doctor.

00:12:12.480 --> 00:12:15.000
It's being quiet now.

00:12:15.610 --> 00:12:16.880
How is it hellish?

00:12:18.220 --> 00:12:19.840
Like it or not, you'll see.

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:22.320
Just stay with me
for a few days.

00:12:22.350 --> 00:12:24.050
Please tell me.

00:12:25.020 --> 00:12:27.010
I'm a little tired today.

00:12:27.060 --> 00:12:29.290
Machiko, let's turn in.

00:12:29.330 --> 00:12:30.520
Yes, dear.

00:12:36.530 --> 00:12:37.930
Doctor...

00:12:37.970 --> 00:12:40.630
Doctor, please come
see my bedroom.

00:12:41.210 --> 00:12:45.580
See how I pass my hard,
pain-filled nights.

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:11.390
Good night, dear.

00:13:11.440 --> 00:13:13.230
Yes... Good night.

00:13:15.510 --> 00:13:18.770
Wake me at seven. I have
a meeting at the office at nine.

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:20.570
Yes, dear.

00:13:28.720 --> 00:13:32.950
All he wants is a peaceful
night's sleep without all that!

00:13:33.490 --> 00:13:36.650
He says without it, he feels like
he'll go away somewhere.

00:13:39.360 --> 00:13:43.270
Long story short,
you gotta slice it, right?

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:44.290
Slice it?

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:47.700
Slice that thing off Mr. Big-Shot
and it'll all be okay!

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:50.200
You think that'll solve it?

00:13:50.240 --> 00:13:51.640
Won't it?

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:52.540
I don't know.

00:13:52.580 --> 00:13:54.240
You don't?

00:13:56.920 --> 00:13:58.010
Taneda.

00:13:58.050 --> 00:13:59.850
Sir? I'm here!

00:14:00.320 --> 00:14:01.910
Forgive me.

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:03.440
Sir, it's all right!

00:14:03.490 --> 00:14:06.690
Forgive me, but I don't think
I can control it tonight.

00:14:08.330 --> 00:14:09.380
Master!

00:14:10.060 --> 00:14:13.460
Please handle tomorrow's
meeting with Machiko.

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:15.690
As you wish, sir!

00:14:26.440 --> 00:14:30.070
<i>Just before dawn, the servant</i>
<i>Taneda came to my room.</i>

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:42.920
It happens every two or three days.

00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:45.930
Master Koichiro
always comes back.

00:14:48.130 --> 00:14:50.690
Please, this must be
kept an absolute secret!

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:54.190
So please, you must wait
here at the mansion!

00:14:54.610 --> 00:14:56.270
I can't.

00:14:57.110 --> 00:15:00.410
I can't complete my work
without a patient.

00:15:00.810 --> 00:15:03.680
Either I cancel my contract
or I go look for the patient.

00:15:03.720 --> 00:15:05.010
Which shall it be?

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:07.110
Dr. Black Jack!

00:15:07.450 --> 00:15:08.680
Taneda!

00:15:09.420 --> 00:15:11.890
Let the Doctor do what he must.

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:14.820
If the Doctor
cancels his contract...

00:15:14.860 --> 00:15:16.950
Koichiro will lose
his last hope.

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:18.120
Mistress!

00:15:18.160 --> 00:15:20.460
Do whatever you can
to assist him!

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:21.490
Yes, Mistress!

00:15:26.470 --> 00:15:28.230
Mr. Taneda?

00:15:28.270 --> 00:15:29.430
Uh, yes?

00:15:29.470 --> 00:15:32.200
Do whatever you can
to assist us!

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:33.270
Yes, Miss!

00:15:34.310 --> 00:15:37.580
Well, I've never
climbed Tokyo Tower, so...

00:15:38.420 --> 00:15:41.110
Then we gotta go
see Rainbow Bridge!

00:15:41.150 --> 00:15:42.880
Then see the Umi Hotaru!

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:46.620
Then how about a meal
at Sea Para Land?

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:49.860
Any ideas?

00:15:50.700 --> 00:15:53.890
This isn't the first time
the patient's run off.

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:55.700
It's written
all over your face.

00:15:58.140 --> 00:15:59.870
Where has Koichiro gone?

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:05.710
It's as you say, sir.

00:16:05.740 --> 00:16:08.340
Master Koichiro has
been doing this...

00:16:08.380 --> 00:16:11.280
since he was ten years old.

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:12.510
Ten years old...

00:16:13.020 --> 00:16:17.390
I don't know where he goes
or what he does.

00:16:17.420 --> 00:16:22.190
All I do is wait for
him to come home safely.

00:16:22.930 --> 00:16:26.390
As though nobody knew,
as if he'd done nothing,

00:16:26.430 --> 00:16:29.490
he'd be greeted warmly
and given a bath...

00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:31.130
and a change of clothes.

00:16:32.700 --> 00:16:34.600
Is this the carbuncle's doing?

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:36.870
I don't know.

00:16:37.440 --> 00:16:41.310
I think you've observed Koichiro
as a doctor might.

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:42.570
I want your opinion.

00:16:42.610 --> 00:16:43.510
We do!

00:16:43.550 --> 00:16:45.850
I know the basics of medicine,

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:49.120
but I dropped out of medical
school midway through!

00:16:49.390 --> 00:16:52.120
I'm not asking if you have
a diploma or a medical license!

00:16:53.290 --> 00:16:54.620
From where I stand,
you seem to have...

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:57.060
a fairly broad
and detailed knowledge.

00:16:57.800 --> 00:17:01.530
The way you prepared that room
for me makes that clear.

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:06.870
Anything. Tell me anything
you've noticed.

00:17:06.910 --> 00:17:08.840
His heart...

00:17:08.870 --> 00:17:12.900
The master won't allow me
to see what's truly in his heart.

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:16.700
He's crying!
Doctor, Mr. Taneda's crying!

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:21.410
You're saying this could
have a psychological cause?

00:17:25.590 --> 00:17:31.120
I once followed Master Koichiro
to this area before losing him.

00:17:43.740 --> 00:17:47.580
Hey! Hey, you,
with the yellow umbrella!

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:52.770
You waiting
for your boyfriend there?

00:17:52.820 --> 00:17:56.650
I was thinking it's not the best
date spot around, is it?

00:17:57.890 --> 00:17:59.650
I was waiting for you.

00:17:59.890 --> 00:18:02.020
Huh? All right!

00:18:02.060 --> 00:18:04.290
Just what I like to hear!

00:18:05.030 --> 00:18:07.830
You can have
a drink with me, if you like.

00:18:09.370 --> 00:18:12.170
A beauty like you
saying stuff like that! Scary!

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:14.470
Okay. If you don't want to...

00:18:17.610 --> 00:18:19.040
Hey! Wait up!

00:18:23.180 --> 00:18:24.580
Lemme outta here.

00:18:27.720 --> 00:18:29.810
Inspector, wait! Please!

00:18:29.850 --> 00:18:31.150
We have to call a meeting at HQ!

00:18:31.190 --> 00:18:34.650
I'm going home tonight!
It's a birthday, after all!

00:18:34.690 --> 00:18:36.990
But, sir, a birthday
at a time like this...

00:18:37.030 --> 00:18:39.160
This is for Kami!

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:41.250
Inspector!

00:18:52.280 --> 00:18:53.970
Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:18:55.210 --> 00:18:59.150
Hi! I thought I saw you
from the patrol car before.

00:19:01.050 --> 00:19:04.920
So, what's Dr. No-License
doing here?

00:19:04.960 --> 00:19:08.620
If you want to talk to me,
bring a warrant!

00:19:09.360 --> 00:19:12.590
I love how you talk,
Dr. No-License!

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:13.460
Nothing to do?

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:14.760
I don't have to answer that.

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:18.360
Have a drink with me.
Today's been an awful day.

00:19:18.400 --> 00:19:20.890
I got it! The cops fired him!

00:19:23.240 --> 00:19:26.610
It's been an awful day
for Kami's birthday.

00:19:26.980 --> 00:19:28.780
What do you mean?

00:19:29.310 --> 00:19:34.410
I'd be a much happier man if that
guy hadn't appeared in this world.

00:19:37.920 --> 00:19:41.120
Don't worry, Doc. I'm working
Juvenile Division now.

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:45.690
Besides, I don't have anything
to nail your ass with, anyway.

00:19:45.730 --> 00:19:50.460
God, how did Takasugi the Ogre
end up working Juvie?

00:19:50.900 --> 00:19:53.430
So quit being a cop.

00:19:54.110 --> 00:19:56.670
I've been thinking
about doing that lately.

00:19:56.710 --> 00:20:00.800
The pay sucks and I need
more money as my kid gets bigger.

00:20:00.850 --> 00:20:02.840
Maybe I could make
a better living...

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:05.280
as a servant
for Dr. No-License here.

00:20:05.320 --> 00:20:06.410
<i>Tsukune.</i>

00:20:06.450 --> 00:20:08.040
<i>Tsukune, coming up!</i>
<i>Tsukune:</i> A small ground chicken patty.

00:20:08.090 --> 00:20:11.850
Thing is, right now
I've got a real case...

00:20:11.890 --> 00:20:12.820
<i>Tsukune!</i>

00:20:12.860 --> 00:20:13.650
<i>Tsukune!</i>

00:20:14.360 --> 00:20:16.660
A little of the old fire's
back in me, I guess.

00:20:17.100 --> 00:20:19.000
Here, mister.
<i>Tsukune</i> for you, too.

00:20:19.960 --> 00:20:21.660
<i>Tsukune,</i> huh?

00:20:22.930 --> 00:20:25.800
At the very least, I can look
like I'm going out with a bang.

00:20:27.140 --> 00:20:29.700
Wow, I still don't get it.

00:20:30.780 --> 00:20:33.470
What's a girl like you
doing with a guy like me?

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:37.680
Do people need reasons
to get to know each other?

00:20:38.220 --> 00:20:40.480
No, I suppose they don't.

00:20:41.290 --> 00:20:42.550
I love you!

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:44.560
I find that hard to believe.

00:20:45.290 --> 00:20:46.550
Really...

00:20:46.590 --> 00:20:48.530
But I like lies.

00:20:49.790 --> 00:20:51.390
They're fun.

00:20:53.830 --> 00:20:56.800
Um, my name's Sasaki.
YB Commercial Affairs.

00:20:56.830 --> 00:20:58.460
And you are?

00:20:58.500 --> 00:20:59.870
Ryuko.

00:20:59.900 --> 00:21:01.390
Miss... Ryuko...

00:21:02.470 --> 00:21:04.240
Yes. Ryuko.

00:21:04.480 --> 00:21:11.180
So, uh, can you maybe give me
your address or your cell number?

00:21:12.150 --> 00:21:16.250
Or maybe it's best
if I don't know that, huh?

00:21:17.090 --> 00:21:18.280
Shall we drink?

00:21:18.320 --> 00:21:19.720
Oh, sure, sure, sure.

00:21:20.890 --> 00:21:22.620
Have any children?

00:21:22.660 --> 00:21:25.320
Yup! Three wives and one child.

00:21:25.360 --> 00:21:27.090
Um, the other way around,
I mean.

00:21:27.130 --> 00:21:28.190
I see.

00:21:28.230 --> 00:21:29.600
Exactly!

00:21:33.200 --> 00:21:36.110
I know I promised
we'd just have a drink.

00:21:36.140 --> 00:21:38.540
But, well... We can't
just drift off like this!

00:21:38.580 --> 00:21:41.840
Go on if you're going.
Don't if you're not.

00:21:41.880 --> 00:21:42.940
Choose.

00:21:42.980 --> 00:21:44.170
I'll go!

00:21:47.650 --> 00:21:50.020
Ryuko, you are
just the coolest!

00:21:56.090 --> 00:21:58.890
This all must be destiny.

00:22:20.050 --> 00:22:21.850
You have a wife and children!

00:22:21.890 --> 00:22:23.480
Wh-What?

00:22:23.520 --> 00:22:26.320
Did you even consider
how you hurt them?

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:28.920
N-No, but now
that I think about it...

00:22:29.290 --> 00:22:30.690
Too late.

00:22:41.640 --> 00:22:43.770
Great! Let's keep
the party going!

00:22:43.810 --> 00:22:46.280
Karaoke!
Let's sing our brains out!

00:22:46.310 --> 00:22:47.540
I wanna go!

00:22:47.580 --> 00:22:48.270
Pinoko!

00:22:49.250 --> 00:22:52.880
I'll see him home.
Where do you live, sir?

00:22:52.920 --> 00:22:54.850
Nishieifuku...

00:22:55.720 --> 00:22:58.880
Don't worry about me.
You wanna go home, then go.

00:22:58.920 --> 00:23:01.360
I'll drink some more, then
spend the night at a police box.

00:23:04.230 --> 00:23:07.790
West Shinjuku. Murder at
the love hotel Kashmir reported!

00:23:08.230 --> 00:23:10.830
Victim is male, 37 years of age.

00:23:10.870 --> 00:23:13.300
<i>Suspect is a woman he entered with,</i>
<i>dressed like an office lady.</i>

00:23:13.340 --> 00:23:15.100
<i>She was carrying</i>
<i>a yellow umbrella.</i>

00:23:15.610 --> 00:23:17.940
<i>She's believed to be</i>
<i>on the run right now.</i>

00:23:18.210 --> 00:23:20.540
<i>This seems to be like case M-37!</i>

00:23:20.680 --> 00:23:25.010
<i>We've scrambled all units</i>
<i>in Shinjuku as of 23:50 hours!</i>

00:23:25.850 --> 00:23:28.790
Hey! Lemme in! I gotta
get to West Shinjuku!

00:23:41.470 --> 00:23:44.130
Gimme a ring sometime!
We'll go drinking again!

00:23:45.500 --> 00:23:48.170
Outta the way! Lemme through!

00:23:50.980 --> 00:23:54.640
Doctor, let's go back
to Akamedai for tonight.

00:23:55.110 --> 00:23:56.740
Let's do it, Doctor.

00:23:56.780 --> 00:23:58.750
It's pouring, and I'm sleepy.

00:23:59.580 --> 00:24:03.280
Mr. Taneda, would you
please take Pinoko back?

00:24:03.320 --> 00:24:05.310
I'd like to search
the area a little more.

00:24:05.360 --> 00:24:06.320
Uh, well...

00:24:06.360 --> 00:24:08.620
But you don't have
a single clue.

00:24:08.660 --> 00:24:10.320
Not a single thing!

00:24:10.360 --> 00:24:12.560
Which is why I have
to find a clue.

00:24:13.460 --> 00:24:15.430
Let's go, Mr. Taneda.

00:24:15.470 --> 00:24:17.400
Once he says that,
there's no reasoning with him.

00:24:17.440 --> 00:24:18.830
Y-Yes, Miss!

00:24:21.040 --> 00:24:21.870
Hold it!

00:24:26.580 --> 00:24:30.310
Why are you sweating?
And your pulse so high?

00:24:30.350 --> 00:24:33.980
Uh, I sweat a lot and I have
high blood pressure.

00:24:34.020 --> 00:24:35.920
Something here has shocked you.

00:24:35.950 --> 00:24:37.580
N-No, not really.

00:24:38.460 --> 00:24:39.150
Really...

00:24:39.190 --> 00:24:40.050
Yes, sir!

00:24:41.590 --> 00:24:42.460
Here.

00:24:43.530 --> 00:24:45.320
Contact me if anything happens.

00:24:45.360 --> 00:24:47.300
Be careful!

00:24:52.670 --> 00:24:54.070
Hey, mister!

00:24:56.470 --> 00:24:58.140
Yeah, you.

00:24:59.240 --> 00:25:01.400
<i>I wandered for an hour,</i>
<i>finding nothing.</i>

00:25:01.580 --> 00:25:03.740
<i>Then a voice called out to me.</i>

00:25:03.780 --> 00:25:05.680
Got any drugs?

00:25:05.720 --> 00:25:08.210
Not the sort you'd want.

00:25:08.250 --> 00:25:10.850
No, I mean real drugs.

00:25:10.890 --> 00:25:13.880
Like what you give sick people.
If not, can I have some money?

00:25:13.920 --> 00:25:15.620
I can go to the store.

00:25:15.660 --> 00:25:17.130
Are you hurt?

00:25:17.160 --> 00:25:21.390
Not for me, but my friend's
bleeding really bad.

00:25:23.700 --> 00:25:24.600
This way!

00:25:25.200 --> 00:25:27.530
My friend came to crash
at my place.

00:25:27.970 --> 00:25:30.530
It's a major pain, coming
out of the blue like this!

00:25:30.570 --> 00:25:31.700
This way!

00:25:39.650 --> 00:25:40.340
See?

00:25:40.380 --> 00:25:42.750
I see. She is bleeding badly.

00:25:42.790 --> 00:25:45.550
Hey, sis, this guy's a doctor.

00:25:45.590 --> 00:25:47.450
You'll be okay now.

00:25:48.830 --> 00:25:50.420
You're starting to run a fever.

00:25:50.960 --> 00:25:54.330
Come on, let me
see that wound. I'll treat it.

00:26:08.010 --> 00:26:09.840
My house!

00:26:38.040 --> 00:26:40.010
Get some rest, sir.

00:26:41.150 --> 00:26:44.440
A change of clothes, Doctor.
You must be soaked.

00:26:45.180 --> 00:26:47.010
Any sign of the patient?

00:26:47.050 --> 00:26:49.110
Master Koichiro, you mean, sir?

00:26:49.150 --> 00:26:51.350
Has he returned?

00:26:51.390 --> 00:26:54.950
Yes, sir! About an hour ago!

00:26:55.290 --> 00:26:56.950
Then he's in his bedroom?

00:26:57.390 --> 00:27:00.120
Wait, Doctor! Please, wait!

00:27:00.160 --> 00:27:03.400
Master Koichiro is asleep now!

00:27:03.430 --> 00:27:06.060
I'm examining him!
It doesn't matter if he's asleep!

00:27:06.440 --> 00:27:08.060
Doctor!

00:27:20.450 --> 00:27:22.010
Doctor!

00:27:22.050 --> 00:27:23.180
Unlock it!

00:27:27.060 --> 00:27:28.920
<i>My hunch was right.</i>

00:27:29.390 --> 00:27:32.850
<i>That this woman may actually</i>
<i>be Koichiro Tsuzuki.</i>

00:27:33.230 --> 00:27:37.170
<i>Because she had an identical</i>
<i>human-faced carbuncle on her hand.</i>

00:27:37.940 --> 00:27:41.100
<i>Still, I find this</i>
<i>hard to believe!</i>

00:27:41.310 --> 00:27:44.330
This woman is actually Koichiro?

00:27:45.710 --> 00:27:48.640
We were going
to tell you eventually, Doctor.

00:27:50.610 --> 00:27:52.340
I am Ryuko.

00:27:52.380 --> 00:27:54.540
You say I'm "Koichiro?"

00:27:54.590 --> 00:27:57.990
Please! Don't compare me
to that weakling!

00:27:58.020 --> 00:28:00.510
He can't do anything on his own!

00:28:43.930 --> 00:28:46.330
Well, if it isn't Mariko.

00:28:47.270 --> 00:28:48.970
Oh, crap!

00:28:49.010 --> 00:28:51.530
I'm not after you! Wait!

00:28:52.540 --> 00:28:54.440
You're broke
and probably starving.

00:28:54.480 --> 00:28:56.210
Let's get some food in you.
Come on!

00:28:57.950 --> 00:29:01.410
Quit the drugs
and quit wandering around!

00:29:01.450 --> 00:29:04.790
Go home on our terms
and you can avoid reform school.

00:29:05.260 --> 00:29:09.280
Oh, what's the point.
You'll just end up back there.

00:29:09.890 --> 00:29:11.380
This chicken's tough!

00:29:11.430 --> 00:29:12.790
Don't push it!

00:29:12.830 --> 00:29:13.850
Sure, sure.

00:29:13.900 --> 00:29:16.590
By the way, Mari,
I'm looking for some info.

00:29:17.800 --> 00:29:19.700
What's she done?

00:29:21.370 --> 00:29:23.100
You know her?

00:29:23.140 --> 00:29:24.970
Will you buy me
a chocolate parfait for dessert?

00:29:25.010 --> 00:29:27.440
Yeah, sure! How about
a side of <i>tsukune,</i> too?

00:29:31.580 --> 00:29:35.110
Relax. Just try
to fall into a half-sleep.

00:29:35.550 --> 00:29:37.110
Yes, sir...

00:29:38.690 --> 00:29:42.130
Answer as honestly
and calmly as you can.

00:29:42.760 --> 00:29:44.790
Question one:

00:29:44.830 --> 00:29:48.790
Where did you go yesterday
and what did you do?

00:29:50.100 --> 00:29:53.700
I think I was asleep...

00:29:53.740 --> 00:29:54.230
Where?

00:29:56.410 --> 00:30:00.400
In my bedroom
in my home, I think...

00:30:01.350 --> 00:30:05.410
Did you dream?
Was your sleep fitful?

00:30:05.950 --> 00:30:09.150
Nothing... There was nothing.

00:30:09.190 --> 00:30:11.780
I remember nothing.

00:30:11.820 --> 00:30:15.280
I was just left
with a helpless sense of dread.

00:30:16.890 --> 00:30:19.060
Next question:

00:30:19.100 --> 00:30:22.290
Do you know
a woman named Ryuko?

00:30:24.770 --> 00:30:27.760
It's Ryuko.
We don't know her surname.

00:30:29.370 --> 00:30:31.900
Yes, I remember her.

00:30:31.940 --> 00:30:35.640
She's beautiful.
She's my friend.

00:30:35.680 --> 00:30:36.610
Your friend?

00:30:38.120 --> 00:30:43.710
Yes. When I'm alone,
she talks to me.

00:30:43.750 --> 00:30:48.350
From behind.
She doesn't let me see her.

00:30:48.390 --> 00:30:51.360
She cheers me up
and embraces me gently...

00:30:51.400 --> 00:30:52.660
from behind, too.

00:30:52.700 --> 00:30:56.360
How do you know she's beautiful
if you've never seen her?

00:30:56.400 --> 00:30:57.590
Oh, I know.

00:30:59.040 --> 00:31:02.870
No woman is as lovely
and pure as she.

00:31:06.580 --> 00:31:08.910
Have you any other
friends besides Ryuko?

00:31:12.380 --> 00:31:13.480
Your friends?

00:31:14.320 --> 00:31:17.750
Of course he does!
We're right here!

00:31:20.890 --> 00:31:22.860
Your name! Tell me your name!

00:31:23.230 --> 00:31:25.750
No way, mister! No way!

00:31:28.870 --> 00:31:32.730
Doctor, what am I doing here?

00:31:33.370 --> 00:31:36.740
It's all right.
You've just had a little nap.

00:31:40.080 --> 00:31:42.570
<i>Koichiro Tsuzuki. Age: 35.</i>

00:31:42.610 --> 00:31:46.380
<i>Clearly presenting characteristics</i>
<i>of Dissociative Identity Disorder.</i>

00:31:47.020 --> 00:31:50.150
<i>Also known as</i>
<i>Multiple Personality Disorder.</i>

00:31:54.390 --> 00:31:57.020
<i>Multiple Personality Disorder...</i>

00:31:57.060 --> 00:32:00.030
<i>is when a single person contains</i>
<i>many separate personalities.</i>

00:32:00.060 --> 00:32:04.400
<i>Each personality behaves completely</i>
<i>differently from the others.</i>

00:32:04.840 --> 00:32:07.130
<i>In many cases, what becomes</i>
<i>the base personality...</i>

00:32:07.170 --> 00:32:10.440
<i>is unaware of</i>
<i>the other personalities within him.</i>

00:32:11.240 --> 00:32:15.080
<i>He may possibly suffer memory loss</i>
<i>when they take over.</i>

00:32:15.650 --> 00:32:19.140
<i>The exact cause of this disorder</i>
<i>is a subject...</i>

00:32:19.420 --> 00:32:23.580
<i>which is studied and investigated</i>
<i>all over the world, even now.</i>

00:32:24.460 --> 00:32:27.080
<i>Multiple Personality Disorder.</i>

00:32:27.190 --> 00:32:30.560
<i>It may be eventually found</i>
<i>that this is a new illness...</i>

00:32:30.590 --> 00:32:33.590
<i>brought about by the stress</i>
<i>of modern business.</i>

00:32:34.300 --> 00:32:36.890
<i>This falls outside</i>
<i>my area of expertise...</i>

00:32:36.930 --> 00:32:40.460
<i>but I can recognize</i>
<i>a horrible mental disorder...</i>

00:32:40.500 --> 00:32:43.530
<i>which tears a person apart</i>
<i>from the inside.</i>

00:32:47.380 --> 00:32:49.470
<i>And in his case...</i>

00:32:49.510 --> 00:32:52.410
<i>how is it connected</i>
<i>to the human-faced carbuncle?</i>

00:32:52.450 --> 00:32:55.440
<i>What influence</i>
<i>does it have over him?</i>

00:32:55.690 --> 00:32:58.680
<i>Can I really help him?</i>

00:32:58.720 --> 00:33:02.490
<i>For the first time,</i>
<i>doubt gnawed at my self-confidence.</i>

00:33:03.130 --> 00:33:05.490
Love! Love!
Love, love, love!

00:33:05.530 --> 00:33:07.050
Pinoko!

00:33:07.530 --> 00:33:11.060
The human-faced carbuncle
didn't manifest on his abdomen.

00:33:12.640 --> 00:33:17.160
<i>It not only moved, but appeared</i>
<i>in multiple places at once.</i>

00:33:21.750 --> 00:33:24.440
<i>Even more amazing,</i>
<i>a male patient transformed...</i>

00:33:24.480 --> 00:33:27.210
<i>into a completely</i>
<i>different-looking female!</i>

00:33:27.990 --> 00:33:30.350
<i>Facial structure,</i>
<i>skin tone, voice...</i>

00:33:30.390 --> 00:33:32.250
<i>All completely female!</i>

00:33:32.290 --> 00:33:36.060
<i>Even her height</i>
<i>was different from Koichiro's.</i>

00:33:36.090 --> 00:33:39.620
It's really bugging you,
isn't it, Doctor?

00:33:39.730 --> 00:33:41.250
<i>For a change like that</i>
<i>to occur...</i>

00:33:41.300 --> 00:33:44.530
<i>would require a sudden and massive</i>
<i>secretion of hormones.</i>

00:33:45.000 --> 00:33:48.670
<i>Like GH, TSH, ACTH, and so on.</i>

00:33:48.710 --> 00:33:52.470
<i>The carbuncle might have a strong</i>
<i>control over his sub-thalamus.</i>

00:33:52.510 --> 00:33:54.480
<i>Could that be it?</i>

00:33:55.610 --> 00:34:00.240
<i>Most multiple personality cases</i>
<i>are caused by a profound trauma.</i>

00:34:02.650 --> 00:34:04.680
Have some coffee!

00:34:05.060 --> 00:34:09.650
<i>Trauma... Like a psychological wound</i>
<i>suffered in childhood...</i>

00:34:11.930 --> 00:34:14.990
I know you're in there,
Dr. No-License!

00:34:15.030 --> 00:34:17.400
You gotta at least let me in
to ask to see a warrant!

00:34:17.770 --> 00:34:19.860
Wait, I know. Taneda!

00:34:19.900 --> 00:34:21.460
Send out Taneda the butler!

00:34:22.140 --> 00:34:23.130
Taneda?

00:34:23.810 --> 00:34:25.400
I'm opening the gate now.

00:34:28.710 --> 00:34:32.340
I've connected you
with the yellow umbrella woman.

00:34:32.380 --> 00:34:34.410
You met her in Shinjuku.

00:34:36.190 --> 00:34:38.780
A homeless girl
named Mariko told me.

00:34:40.520 --> 00:34:42.490
As is my habit,

00:34:42.530 --> 00:34:46.220
I memorized the butler's
license plate and found this place.

00:34:47.460 --> 00:34:51.730
Amazing. Your patient's
the head of the Tsuzuki Group.

00:34:51.770 --> 00:34:55.000
A big-shot like him for a client
must pay a lot of money.

00:34:55.340 --> 00:34:58.000
You better believe it!

00:34:58.540 --> 00:35:01.710
Then you go chasing
after the yellow umbrella girl...

00:35:01.750 --> 00:35:03.540
from Mariko's cardboard shack.

00:35:03.580 --> 00:35:06.610
I want to ask you about
what happened after that.

00:35:07.120 --> 00:35:10.450
I lost sight of her soon after.
That's it.

00:35:10.490 --> 00:35:15.020
Listen, I've got you practicing
unlicensed medicine here.

00:35:15.060 --> 00:35:16.580
You'd better answer me.

00:35:21.370 --> 00:35:25.170
So, I'm wasting my time
here, huh? Oh, well...

00:35:26.300 --> 00:35:28.130
Good day, sir.

00:35:28.170 --> 00:35:29.900
Later! Let's go drinking again!

00:35:29.940 --> 00:35:30.910
Of course, sir...

00:35:38.850 --> 00:35:40.840
I heard the police were here.

00:35:40.880 --> 00:35:42.350
Yes.

00:35:42.390 --> 00:35:44.290
I wonder how much they know.

00:35:44.320 --> 00:35:46.080
W-Well...

00:35:46.960 --> 00:35:51.090
We should prepare ourselves
for the inevitable.

00:35:51.430 --> 00:35:54.090
Mistress, don't trouble yourself!

00:35:54.260 --> 00:35:58.830
When that time comes,
I will protect Master Koichiro!

00:36:01.610 --> 00:36:05.100
I will be removing
the tumor at dawn.

00:36:07.480 --> 00:36:09.470
Whether the patient
will be cured of...

00:36:09.510 --> 00:36:12.480
his Dissociative Identity
Disorder, I cannot say.

00:36:16.020 --> 00:36:19.960
But that is the only treatment
I can offer for now.

00:36:24.960 --> 00:36:27.450
The operation is tied to the
patient's psychological disorder.

00:36:27.500 --> 00:36:30.230
I pray it will offer a clue
to curing his illness.

00:36:31.440 --> 00:36:33.400
Dr. Black Jack!

00:36:34.000 --> 00:36:35.870
Please do what you can.

00:36:36.370 --> 00:36:38.270
Then will you tell me?

00:36:38.310 --> 00:36:41.140
Everything you know
about the patient.

00:36:43.050 --> 00:36:45.450
It's your duty
if you wish to help him!

00:36:48.120 --> 00:36:51.580
Gentlemen, this investigation
is moving into its final stages!

00:36:56.360 --> 00:36:58.880
What's up? Did the suspect
turn himself in?

00:36:58.930 --> 00:37:00.950
Another fingerprint was found.

00:37:01.000 --> 00:37:02.660
Fingerprint?

00:37:02.700 --> 00:37:04.860
The boy and the yellow
umbrella woman.

00:37:04.900 --> 00:37:08.740
We found another print
that matches theirs.

00:37:12.680 --> 00:37:15.140
This new fingerprint
we've found...

00:37:15.180 --> 00:37:18.170
is a different size
from the previous two...

00:37:18.220 --> 00:37:20.980
which means it took
some time to match it.

00:37:21.020 --> 00:37:23.610
So, this one's
an adult male, now?

00:37:23.650 --> 00:37:25.850
Exactly.

00:37:25.890 --> 00:37:28.320
Koichiro Tsuzuki. Age 35.

00:37:28.860 --> 00:37:31.230
He was found guilty
of illegal campaign contributions...

00:37:31.260 --> 00:37:33.820
to the Conservative Party
in the last general election.

00:37:34.300 --> 00:37:36.630
However, the sentence
was suspended with a fine,

00:37:36.670 --> 00:37:38.000
so he never went to prison.

00:37:38.030 --> 00:37:41.230
We found the print in his file.

00:37:41.270 --> 00:37:43.670
What?

00:37:43.710 --> 00:37:45.680
Gentlemen,
as you already know...

00:37:45.710 --> 00:37:48.200
this is the head
of the Tsuzuki Group.

00:37:48.250 --> 00:37:52.080
He has a lot of influence
in the economic and political world.

00:37:52.120 --> 00:37:54.140
Right now, our superiors
are discussing it with...

00:37:54.180 --> 00:37:55.880
the Minister of Justice
and the District Attorney.

00:37:56.520 --> 00:37:59.850
Don't make any moves
until we have a warrant!

00:38:00.660 --> 00:38:02.720
Are you saying
he was dressed as a woman?

00:38:03.060 --> 00:38:05.490
How can an adult
impersonate a child?

00:38:06.500 --> 00:38:09.560
Are prints of different sizes
going to stand up as evidence?

00:38:13.000 --> 00:38:16.000
Hey, Takasugi!
Got another birthday to celebrate?

00:38:16.040 --> 00:38:18.030
Shut up.

00:38:20.240 --> 00:38:23.470
Love! Love! Love, love, love!

00:38:27.520 --> 00:38:29.510
I just want
to tell you one thing.

00:38:30.120 --> 00:38:31.750
What?

00:38:31.790 --> 00:38:33.920
You've got till tomorrow morning
to get out of there.

00:38:33.960 --> 00:38:36.690
That mansion's being watched.

00:38:38.360 --> 00:38:40.120
This is my thanks
for the <i>tsukune.</i>

00:38:43.300 --> 00:38:45.100
<i>5:13 AM</i>

00:38:45.970 --> 00:38:48.700
<i>The rain continues to fall</i>
<i>as dawn approaches.</i>

00:38:48.740 --> 00:38:52.370
<i>The gloom of the night</i>
<i>lingers on.</i>

00:38:55.150 --> 00:38:56.840
Confirm nitrous and oxygen flow.

00:38:57.650 --> 00:38:59.170
Yes, Doctor. All okay.

00:38:59.720 --> 00:39:00.710
Vitals?

00:39:02.020 --> 00:39:03.650
Nothing unusual.

00:39:03.690 --> 00:39:05.850
Very well. Beginning surgery!

00:39:10.830 --> 00:39:12.820
Here... you... go!

00:39:19.300 --> 00:39:25.140
Master Koichiro's childhood
was a sad and lonely one.

00:39:26.340 --> 00:39:28.900
The Tsuzuki line
is a long and noble one.

00:39:28.950 --> 00:39:33.640
And from birth, Master Koichiro
was raised to be its leader.

00:39:34.420 --> 00:39:38.350
Naive. Gentle. However you
called it, he was an insular boy...

00:39:38.390 --> 00:39:40.750
and his training
to be the eighth...

00:39:40.790 --> 00:39:43.120
master of the house
began at age three.

00:39:44.900 --> 00:39:48.850
Pulse: 76.
Pressure: Steady at 24 over 70.

00:39:49.200 --> 00:39:52.330
In the nine years
between age three and age twelve...

00:39:52.370 --> 00:39:56.900
he underwent his rigorous training
at the estate in Karuizawa.

00:39:56.940 --> 00:39:59.970
He always had
at least ten tutors.

00:40:00.010 --> 00:40:02.600
Everything he did
was according to a schedule.

00:40:02.650 --> 00:40:06.340
He was under
his father's complete control.

00:40:08.020 --> 00:40:12.180
But Master Koichiro
could only bear it all...

00:40:12.220 --> 00:40:14.520
because Mistress Yukiko was there.

00:40:15.890 --> 00:40:18.920
She was Master Koichiro's mother.

00:40:18.960 --> 00:40:22.130
She was gentle, and had
an almost angelic beauty,

00:40:22.170 --> 00:40:25.690
with a voice as clear
and soft as falling snow.

00:40:25.740 --> 00:40:29.100
She always carried
a yellow umbrella...

00:40:29.270 --> 00:40:31.830
And so... And so,
if Mistress Yukiko...

00:40:31.880 --> 00:40:34.070
hadn't been treated that way!

00:40:41.790 --> 00:40:45.920
Mama! Mama, don't leave!

00:40:47.060 --> 00:40:48.750
<i>Mama!</i>

00:40:49.290 --> 00:40:50.380
Koichiro!

00:40:52.560 --> 00:40:54.000
Forgive me, Koichiro!

00:40:54.600 --> 00:40:57.660
Be kind to your new mother!

00:40:57.870 --> 00:41:00.030
It was an act of madness...

00:41:00.070 --> 00:41:04.030
In order to take his lover
as his true wife...

00:41:04.070 --> 00:41:06.270
the seventh master of the house
forcibly divorced Yukiko!

00:41:06.310 --> 00:41:07.140
Koichiro!

00:41:10.010 --> 00:41:11.480
Be well!

00:41:21.290 --> 00:41:24.060
The human heart
is a fragile thing.

00:41:24.090 --> 00:41:29.430
After returning home, grief took its
toll on Mistress Yukiko's health.

00:41:29.470 --> 00:41:33.960
After a few months,
she took her life.

00:41:41.340 --> 00:41:42.440
Hemoclamp! Suction!

00:41:42.480 --> 00:41:44.740
Got it! Got it! Got it, got it, got it!

00:41:44.850 --> 00:41:48.750
Everything began
from that tragedy.

00:41:52.320 --> 00:41:55.380
Master Koichiro became
more and more withdrawn.

00:41:55.430 --> 00:41:58.120
At times, he strangely
spoke to himself...

00:41:59.160 --> 00:42:03.390
A strange car came
and ate my mama.

00:42:03.430 --> 00:42:06.960
I wonder if she'd come out
if I cut open its belly?

00:42:07.100 --> 00:42:12.010
That was around the time
I first saw "it."

00:42:12.110 --> 00:42:15.080
Please don't
tell anyone, Taneda.

00:42:15.110 --> 00:42:19.010
If they knew, everyone would
hate me. I'd be ashamed...

00:42:19.050 --> 00:42:21.180
Very well. I promise.

00:42:21.220 --> 00:42:24.280
This will be our secret,
Young Master.

00:42:24.320 --> 00:42:25.080
Always?

00:42:25.120 --> 00:42:26.950
Yes! Always!

00:42:29.490 --> 00:42:31.980
I'm going to be removing
the tumor's contents now.

00:42:32.030 --> 00:42:34.050
Keep a close eye
for any changes in his vitals.

00:42:34.100 --> 00:42:35.890
Yes, Doctor. I'll report
on them in sequence.

00:42:35.930 --> 00:42:36.630
Carnigen!

00:42:36.670 --> 00:42:38.630
Yes, Doctor! Carnigen!

00:42:38.670 --> 00:42:41.470
Carnigen! Carnigen!
Carnigen! Got it!

00:42:55.150 --> 00:42:57.810
It must have been
when Master Koichiro...

00:42:57.850 --> 00:42:59.450
graduated high school...

00:42:59.760 --> 00:43:02.730
Mother died because
Father betrayed her!

00:43:02.760 --> 00:43:05.230
Kill him!

00:43:05.260 --> 00:43:07.460
Betrayal cannot be forgiven...

00:43:07.500 --> 00:43:10.490
You should kill him!

00:43:11.130 --> 00:43:14.000
There's nothing worse
than betraying love!

00:43:14.440 --> 00:43:17.500
I shall call you forth, Ryuko!

00:43:17.540 --> 00:43:18.530
Ryuko?

00:43:18.580 --> 00:43:23.710
Yes! A friend created
from your own hatred!

00:43:23.750 --> 00:43:26.940
What is it, Koichiro?
What would you like me to do?

00:43:27.620 --> 00:43:32.020
He's been inviting men out and then
killing them since high school?

00:43:32.890 --> 00:43:36.660
No. Back then, he'd just
threaten them and hit them.

00:43:36.690 --> 00:43:40.220
It only escalated from that
relatively recently.

00:43:40.600 --> 00:43:44.260
He's a gentle man!
He's just sick!

00:43:44.700 --> 00:43:46.190
Madam, I understand.

00:43:47.640 --> 00:43:50.400
That's why we must operate.

00:43:58.950 --> 00:44:00.710
The tumor's vanishing!

00:44:00.750 --> 00:44:03.620
Wow! Then it's a total success!

00:44:04.290 --> 00:44:05.910
I'll begin suturing the skin.

00:44:05.960 --> 00:44:07.320
Kakubari and no. 3 silk!

00:44:07.360 --> 00:44:09.150
I'm on it!

00:44:09.560 --> 00:44:10.490
Huh?

00:44:10.530 --> 00:44:12.520
They're in drawer two.

00:44:13.700 --> 00:44:15.430
Thanks, Taneda!

00:44:32.150 --> 00:44:33.270
Gross!

00:44:49.370 --> 00:44:50.630
A strange car came.

00:44:51.940 --> 00:44:53.800
It ate little Ko's mama.

00:44:55.000 --> 00:45:00.240
I have to cut
their bellies open to save her.

00:45:01.180 --> 00:45:03.810
Who are you?

00:45:03.850 --> 00:45:08.110
I'm Jun, a very old friend
of Koichiro's.

00:45:10.920 --> 00:45:14.580
Wait, please! We're calling
the master right now!

00:45:14.860 --> 00:45:18.790
What? An arrest warrant?
And a search warrant?

00:45:24.100 --> 00:45:25.760
Master Koichiro!

00:45:42.050 --> 00:45:45.110
My master isn't at home now.

00:45:45.150 --> 00:45:49.090
Don't lie! The rear's covered!
He's in here!

00:45:49.130 --> 00:45:51.560
He's overseas,
recovering from an illness...

00:45:51.590 --> 00:45:53.190
Outta the way,
or I'll arrest you!

00:45:53.230 --> 00:45:55.420
Please, sir, allow me
to show you around.

00:45:55.470 --> 00:45:56.860
Grab him!

00:45:57.430 --> 00:45:58.660
Calm down, buddy!

00:46:13.350 --> 00:46:14.750
Drop your weapon!

00:46:15.320 --> 00:46:16.620
Drop it, or I'll shoot!

00:46:26.660 --> 00:46:29.720
Well? Shall we finally end it?

00:46:30.230 --> 00:46:34.140
No! I want to kill
many more unforgivable men!

00:46:34.740 --> 00:46:37.600
I still haven't found
little Ko's mama.

00:46:37.640 --> 00:46:41.080
And what about you, Koichiro?

00:46:41.380 --> 00:46:44.940
I'm so tired. Let it end...

00:46:44.980 --> 00:46:46.880
Then it is decided!

00:47:08.710 --> 00:47:11.570
Darling! Darling...

00:47:12.010 --> 00:47:13.740
Darling!

00:47:13.780 --> 00:47:14.970
Out of the way!

00:47:15.650 --> 00:47:17.370
Gangway! Comin' through!

00:47:25.220 --> 00:47:28.680
<i>He was shot after</i>
<i>throwing himself in front of a gun.</i>

00:47:28.730 --> 00:47:32.660
<i>The bullet pierced the right atrium</i>
<i>through to the right pulmonary apex.</i>

00:47:32.830 --> 00:47:36.770
Doctor... Doctor Black Jack...

00:47:36.800 --> 00:47:41.260
Who... Who am I?

00:47:41.770 --> 00:47:45.000
You are, without a doubt,
Koichiro Tsuzuki.

00:47:45.710 --> 00:47:48.940
You have been
and always shall be.

00:47:57.420 --> 00:47:59.950
<i>Despite immediate</i>
<i>emergency procedures...</i>

00:47:59.990 --> 00:48:04.480
<i>Koichiro Tsuzuki went</i>
<i>into cardiac arrest at 8:18 AM.</i>

00:48:04.690 --> 00:48:10.960
<i>And with him, Ryuko and Jun</i>
<i>also vanished from this world.</i>

00:48:13.070 --> 00:48:16.940
The doctor!
Who was that doctor? Who?

00:48:17.370 --> 00:48:19.770
Bring him! We need to
get a statement from him!

00:48:19.810 --> 00:48:21.830
Um, who are you
talking about, sir?

00:48:22.380 --> 00:48:24.810
The guy who treated
the suspect before!

00:48:24.850 --> 00:48:26.110
Was there one?

00:48:26.150 --> 00:48:27.120
There was!

00:48:27.150 --> 00:48:28.410
I didn't see him.

00:48:28.450 --> 00:48:29.510
Come on!

00:48:29.550 --> 00:48:31.450
I said I didn't see him!

00:48:31.490 --> 00:48:33.150
Oh, I get it.

00:48:34.920 --> 00:48:38.160
Love! Love!
Love, love, love!

00:48:38.190 --> 00:48:41.890
Love! Love!
Love, love, love!

00:48:42.060 --> 00:48:44.160
Wow! Cool!

00:48:44.200 --> 00:48:48.140
<i>Even now, I'm still thinking</i>
<i>about what happened.</i>

00:48:48.470 --> 00:48:51.500
<i>No matter how earnestly</i>
<i>one can wield a scalpel...</i>

00:48:51.540 --> 00:48:54.600
<i>you can't remove</i>
<i>something from a man's soul.</i>

00:48:55.140 --> 00:48:58.580
Love! Love!
Love, love, love!

00:48:58.750 --> 00:49:02.810
<i>And if a scalpel existed</i>
<i>that could cut that deep...</i>

00:49:05.890 --> 00:49:10.950
<i>I think I would be first in line</i>
<i>to order a few of them.</i>

00:49:42.790 --> 00:49:48.250
Remember when
you came to me then,

00:49:49.370 --> 00:49:55.240
trying to show me
the way that love should be?

00:49:56.010 --> 00:50:02.500
You walk alone,
step into the street,

00:50:02.550 --> 00:50:07.810
keeping an eye
looking at me.

00:50:10.750 --> 00:50:13.520
Ah, it's so dazzling bright.

00:50:17.330 --> 00:50:21.960
I have to shut my eyes.

00:50:23.930 --> 00:50:29.340
Ah, in the future facing me,

00:50:29.370 --> 00:50:36.180
the sun burns a fire so bright.
I just begin to feel its light.

00:50:36.850 --> 00:50:40.340
Just persevere,
don't shed a tear,

00:50:40.380 --> 00:50:43.050
don't give up
and fear the worst.

00:50:43.490 --> 00:50:49.390
Just trust yourself above all else.
Put your intuition first.

00:50:50.060 --> 00:50:53.460
You passed along
love so strong...

00:50:53.500 --> 00:50:56.760
it was bursting powerfully.

00:50:56.800 --> 00:50:59.460
Draw it close
to comfort me.

00:50:59.870 --> 00:51:03.310
Just persevere,
don't shed a tear,

00:51:03.340 --> 00:51:06.400
don't give up
and fear the worst.

00:51:06.440 --> 00:51:12.510
Just trust yourself above all else.
Put your intuition first.

00:51:13.020 --> 00:51:16.470
You passed along
love so strong...

00:51:16.520 --> 00:51:19.750
it was bursting powerfully.

00:51:19.790 --> 00:51:23.350
Draw it close
to comfort me.
